{"game": "space-marine-2", "language": "english", "appid": 2183900, "month": "2025-11", "window": 1, "start_date": 1761955200, "end_date": 1762559999, "month_true_total": 2593, "quota": 8, "returned": 8, "pulled_at": "2026-09-11 02:22:30 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "208672479", "author": {"steamid": "76561198043385443", "personaname": "breadly", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/breadbreadbreadbreadz/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 183, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 181, "last_played": 1764381292, "avatar": "02824a7f6e98b080c3dafb134741aa49609895c0"}, "language": "english", "review": "purge da heretix", "timestamp_created": 1762559872, "timestamp_updated": 1762559872, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208671493", "author": {"steamid": "76561197994687559", "personaname": "Carl Marks", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197994687559/", "num_games_owned": 139, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 1440, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 115, "playtime_at_review": 857, "last_played": 1787950128, "avatar": "cde80f50ba4fa74abbd3f7b2b44354ef8e3b1685"}, "language": "english", "review": "the emperor protects", "timestamp_created": 1762558820, "timestamp_updated": 1762558820, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208669757", "author": {"steamid": "76561199240413996", "personaname": "evellere", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/aroonne/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 674, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 432, "last_played": 1786190526, "avatar": "cbe19b8c7b9eda68e0091cd194a0dcc5f9715cf5"}, "language": "english", "review": "this game is genuinely insane, its sorta hard to pick up at first as its not your usual slash and clash however the more you play, you'll realise the skin customisation and campaigns and different gamemodes are just amazing and definitely worth the money", "timestamp_created": 1762556872, "timestamp_updated": 1762556872, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208666293", "author": {"steamid": "76561199096948392", "personaname": "Squirrel_Martyr", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Squirrel_Martyr/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 24, "playtime_forever": 560, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 325, "last_played": 1762638716, "avatar": "07c374a3cb98b92f404a95a6197bb4deb25a0b54"}, "language": "english", "review": "This is quite possibly one of the best games of its type that I have ever played. Full of blood, guts and gore, yet also some of the most beautiful graphics I have ever seen. Executions remind me of Doom Eternal's glory kills, the campaign against the tyranids offers more of a bug-stomper Helldivers feel. and the variety of playstyles and weapon choices seems almost like its taken straight out of Halo. 10/10, an absolute masterpiece. And I'm only 5 hours in!", "timestamp_created": 1762553390, "timestamp_updated": 1762553390, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208661609", "author": {"steamid": "76561197968990136", "personaname": "Soma", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197968990136/", "num_games_owned": 638, "num_reviews": 212, "playtime_forever": 628, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 628, "last_played": 1762549212, "avatar": "ec65d6d4928953b878477d1112cbca271b950769"}, "language": "english", "review": "Space Marine 2 presents a pretty sanitised, shiny view of the 40k universe, which is pretty disappointing, especially after the first game and more recently playing Rogue Trader which leaned fully into the more macabre aspects of the setting and dripped with atmosphere the whole way through. This would be okay if not for the fact the game is pretty boring, it's been designed with co-op play front and center and gameplay consists of run here, kill this, assemble here, run there, kill that, repeat ad infinitum. There are a variety of weapons but to be honest all the guns feel pretty much the same, with the exception of the sniper style ones. There's no real strategy or thinking involved, just superior firepower. Very few of the enemies feel like more than cannon fodder and even the chaos marines are just another mob to mow down. Nothing is scary, nothing gives you pause to think 'oh damn I'm screwed now'. Just keep shooting and you'll be fine. \r\n\r\nThe game looks amazing and runs pretty well considering. I played at 4k on a 5080 with the 4k texture pack and apart from some texture pop-in in cutscenes it was smooth sailing. I only had a couple of crashes which I think can be attributed to mods. The voice acting is good for what it is, but the story unfortunately is pretty basic. \r\n\r\nThis game is obviously designed to be played co-op and I can only assume it's a lot more fun that way, but for me, as a follow up to the first Space marine it's ultimately a let down. \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1762549358, "timestamp_updated": 1762549358, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.476190477609634399", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32541", "os": "Windows 10", "cpu_name": "12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 5080", "vram_size": 15979}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208661019", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039043573", "personaname": "Forgelighter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039043573/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 27313, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 1144, "playtime_at_review": 9545, "last_played": 1788941424, "avatar": "9435fe5d88f30711cfe792af8ae7122593f47159"}, "language": "english", "review": "NO PITY\r\nNO REMORSE\r\nNO FEAR", "timestamp_created": 1762548831, "timestamp_updated": 1762548831, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1725898212", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "208659591", "author": {"steamid": "76561198087232130", "personaname": "AstraGaloi", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/AstraGaloi/", "num_games_owned": 230, "num_reviews": 69, "playtime_forever": 1783, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 702, "deck_playtime_at_review": 6, "last_played": 1765030084, "avatar": "036aa2f2833f316822589d8b0e7fcf06